# Testing methodology

Tier model mirrors `edge-agent-rules` / `python-services-rules`
`testing-verify-flows.mdc`:

| Tier | Purpose | CI? |
|------|---------|-----|
| **Unit** | `cargo test` with fakes/stubs for host/IPC | Yes |
| **Verify** | Integration against fake host + local IPC | Yes when feasible |
| **Device** | Real SoC / GPU / service-manager behaviour | Documented; **not** default CI |

Do not invent environment activation commands — use repo Makefile / README.

